[_description]
Package: com.snowgears.shop.test.testsupport. Test support docstrings.

[_summary]
Test support utilities for the Shop plugin. Base classes and helpers for MockBukkit-based testing including server lifecycle, message assertions, and shop creation flow.

[_careful]

[_careful/Compatibility]
BaseMockBukkitTest brings up a single ServerMock once per test-class. WorldMock spy auto-loads chunks on accessors. Can be removed once changes are pulled into MockBukkit.

[_conclusions]
Test support utilities reduce duplication across test classes and centralize common testing patterns.

[_does]
Provides BaseMockBukkitTest (server lifecycle), PlayerMessageTestUtil (message queue assertions), ShopCreationFlowTestUtil (chest-based shop creation), ShopSpyTestUtil (Mockito spy replacement), TestReflection (reflection helpers).

